{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>Apple 已向開發者釋出即將推出的 iOS 27.3 與 iPadOS 27.3 首個 Beta，距離 iOS 27.2 及 iPadOS 27.2 推出僅一日。已註冊開發者可前往「設定」＞「一般」＞「軟件更新」，選擇加入開發者 Beta 以下載。</p><h2>iOS 27 多項功能仍待推出</h2><p>Apple 先前宣佈的 iOS 27 功能仍待推出，包括重新設計的健康 App，加入 Apple Intelligence 洞察與指導，以及在 <a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/tag/iPhone-Duo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">iPhone Duo</a> 上提供 Reachability 功能。Apple 亦尚未重新引入讓 Safari 利用 Apple Intelligence 修正弱或已外洩密碼的功能。</p><p></p><figure><p><img alt=\"與 Apple Intelligence 相關的圖片\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/afebcb668d58bc944dfe711f741e2f2cde4a09dafb1d4930c3604ccc6e496808/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2F9e9d0333c2d992ad0ef894899ecab800\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><h2>中國擴展與 Telstra RCS</h2><p>Apple 計劃隨 iOS 27.3 更新把 Apple Intelligence 擴展至中國，並可能為澳洲電訊商 Telstra 帶來 RCS 支援。</p><p><p></p><p><p></p><p></p><p></p></p></p><figure><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2087\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b3b25f36473f40759bb31360586de5495e2fa0fc51450dc6d3b9c8848071e0b2/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2F1494d1e8d8119f453a2937f7ffd9d6de\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T19:00:57.439577+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":397,"images":2,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T18:46:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T22:58:39.869603+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T18:58:40.910120+00:00","content_hash":"85e41a59867904d248ccb66d4c6e158e23eb1362148a33e379194381fafe462c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}